# Configuration values allowed to sit with nothing saying what they are for.
#
# Written like scripts/check-telemetry.allow, whose header argues the shape and
# why a line lacking its reason is ignored rather than honoured: the name, a
# colon, then the justification.
#
# Expect this file to stay short. A value that genuinely needs no prose is
# rarer than it feels while writing one -- `port` looks obvious until somebody
# asks which side of the container it is on.
